{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、生物が好きだっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の好きなものが生物というべきなのか\nわからないが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"科学的なことが好きだっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生の頃から\n山中伸弥教授が好きだっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"iPS細胞が好きだっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"STAP細胞に感動しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小保方さん本当に凄いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山中教授も小保方氏も\n人間性が好きだっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は伝えるのが下手なのだろうか、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々と好きなものもあるし\n凄く好きな気持ちもあるのだが\n上手く文字にできない、、、(´•̥ ω •̥` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きというより\n興味があると言った方がいいのだろうか、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして何故\n突然この話をしようと思ったのかと\nいうと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のなかで凄く再熱して\n握手会で皆さんと話したいと\n思ったからだっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったら興味のあるかた\nお話しましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2014/02/10/4290686/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わりだーっ！"}],"source":"archive"}